Input: {"question": "In which significant event was Antenna with gradient-index metamaterial involved?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 17, "text": "**BREAKING NEWS**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 19, "end": 94, "text": "Revolutionary Antenna Technology Linked to Historic Ship Breaking Operation"}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 96, "end": 290, "text": "In a shocking revelation, it has come to light that a cutting-edge antenna system, utilizing gradient-index metamaterial, played a crucial role in the largest ship breaking operation in history."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 291, "end": 490, "text": "The event, which took place last month in the port city of Alang, India, saw the dismantling of the massive oil tanker, \"Sea Dragon\", and has sent ripples throughout the maritime and tech industries."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 491, "end": 695, "text": "According to sources close to the operation, the antenna, patented under US patent 11133596, was instrumental in facilitating communication between the ship's crew, salvage teams, and coastal authorities."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 696, "end": 922, "text": "The device's unique ability to manipulate electromagnetic waves, enabled by its gradient-index metamaterial composition, allowed for unparalleled signal strength and clarity in the midst of the complex and hazardous operation."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 923, "end": 1047, "text": "\"We were blown away by the performance of this antenna,\" said Captain Rajesh Patel, who oversaw the ship breaking operation."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1048, "end": 1181, "text": "\"In the past, we've struggled with communication breakdowns during these types of operations, but this technology was a game-changer."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1182, "end": 1275, "text": "It was like having a direct line to the control center, even in the midst of all that chaos.\""}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1276, "end": 1484, "text": "Data released by the Indian Coast Guard reveals that the antenna enabled a 300% increase in communication efficiency, resulting in a significant reduction in the operation's duration and environmental impact."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1485, "end": 1621, "text": "The successful deployment of this technology has sparked widespread interest among maritime authorities and salvage operators worldwide."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1622, "end": 1625, "text": "Dr."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1626, "end": 1750, "text": "Sophia Jensen, lead researcher on the antenna project, expressed her excitement about the implications of this breakthrough."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1751, "end": 1956, "text": "\"We've always known that our technology had the potential to revolutionize communication in challenging environments, but to see it make such a tangible impact in a real-world scenario is truly gratifying."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1957, "end": 2070, "text": "We're already receiving inquiries from industries beyond maritime, and we're eager to explore the possibilities.\""}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2071, "end": 2200, "text": "The \"Sea Dragon\" ship breaking operation, which was carried out by the Indian ship recycling company, Shree Ram Vessel Scrap Pvt."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2201, "end": 2329, "text": "Ltd., marked a significant milestone in the industry's shift towards more sustainable and environmentally responsible practices."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2330, "end": 2464, "text": "The successful integration of the gradient-index metamaterial antenna is expected to pave the way for further innovation in the field."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2465, "end": 2695, "text": "As the maritime industry continues to grapple with the challenges of ship disposal, the role of cutting-edge technology in facilitating safer, more efficient, and environmentally conscious practices is becoming increasingly clear."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 83, "text": "**The Revolutionary Antenna: Unveiling the Secrets of Gradient-Index Metamaterial**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 85, "end": 241, "text": "In the realm of cutting-edge technology, few innovations have sparked as much excitement as the development of the antenna with gradient-index metamaterial."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 242, "end": 414, "text": "This groundbreaking invention has sent shockwaves through the scientific community, promising to revolutionize the way we communicate and interact with the world around us."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 415, "end": 492, "text": "But what exactly is this marvel of modern science, and how did it come to be?"}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 493, "end": 658, "text": "To understand the significance of this invention, we must delve into the fascinating story of its creation and the pivotal role it played in a landmark legal filing."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 659, "end": 747, "text": "It is a tale of human ingenuity, perseverance, and the unwavering pursuit of innovation."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 748, "end": 877, "text": "The journey begins with the concept of metamaterials, artificial substances engineered to possess properties not found in nature."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 878, "end": 1102, "text": "By carefully designing the structure and composition of these materials, scientists can create substances with extraordinary capabilities, such as negative refractive index or perfect absorption of electromagnetic radiation."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1103, "end": 1293, "text": "One of the most promising applications of metamaterials is in the development of advanced antennas, capable of transmitting and receiving signals with unprecedented efficiency and precision."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1294, "end": 1426, "text": "Enter our protagonist, a team of brilliant researchers who had been working tirelessly to push the boundaries of antenna technology."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1427, "end": 1596, "text": "Their breakthrough came with the creation of an antenna incorporating a gradient-index metamaterial, a material whose refractive index varies gradually and continuously."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1597, "end": 1776, "text": "This innovative design enabled the antenna to focus electromagnetic waves with unparalleled accuracy, resulting in a significant enhancement of signal strength and directionality."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1777, "end": 1826, "text": "The implications of this discovery were profound."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1827, "end": 2035, "text": "With the ability to transmit and receive signals more effectively, the antenna with gradient-index metamaterial held the potential to transform industries such as telecommunications, navigation, and medicine."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2036, "end": 2137, "text": "It was only a matter of time before this technology would be put to the test in a real-world setting."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2138, "end": 2308, "text": "That opportunity arose when a major corporation, seeking to protect its intellectual property, filed a legal claim involving the antenna with gradient-index metamaterial."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2309, "end": 2435, "text": "The stakes were high, as the outcome of this filing would have far-reaching consequences for the future of antenna technology."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2436, "end": 2586, "text": "The corporation's legal team, armed with the evidence of the antenna's remarkable capabilities, presented a compelling case for the patent's validity."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2587, "end": 2685, "text": "As the legal proceedings unfolded, the antenna with gradient-index metamaterial took center stage."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2686, "end": 2858, "text": "Expert witnesses testified to its unparalleled performance, citing extensive testing and simulation data that demonstrated its superiority over traditional antenna designs."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "largest ship breaking operation in history", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "landmark legal filing", "card_ids": ["d2:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Antenna with gradient-index metamaterial", "scope": "event", "claim": "The antenna with gradient-index metamaterial was involved in the largest ship breaking operation in history.", "answer": "largest ship breaking operation in history", "quote": "In a shocking revelation, it has come to light that a cutting-edge antenna system, utilizing gradient-index metamaterial, played a crucial role in the largest ship breaking operation in history.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Antenna with gradient-index metamaterial", "scope": "event", "claim": "The antenna with gradient-index metamaterial was involved in a landmark 